window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The clock is ticking, and it seems like everyone wants a piece of me.</b></p> <p>Alaar wants me to be the savior of the universe. The werewolf Alpha of Ironclaw is obsessed and has sunk to horrifying new depths to get his paws on me. Poor Sarah, the poltergeist, has had a breakdown, and I'm the only one who can stop her from razing Castlemaine to the ground.</p> <p>Even Dwayne is driving me insane. There's no training in this world that could prepare me for dealing with a love-sick battle goose.</p> <p>The only person who I want to have a piece of me, the only person who I want to get closer to...</p> <p>The Vampire Lord. He's suddenly keeping me at arm's length. There's a traitor in our midst, a troublemaker, someone lurking in the background, keeping him away.</p> <p>And I'm making things worse. I can't tell him the truth. Not yet.</p> <p>Ravenous Beasts <i>is book three in The Waif in the Wilds, a fun, fast-paced urban fantasy series by bestselling author Lauretta Hignett.</i></p>"; 
